{"book":"exponents","bookTitle":"Exponents, squares and roots","concept":5,"title":"Multiplying and dividing powers","grades":"Grade 8","goal":"I can multiply and divide powers that have the same base.","teach":"When you multiply powers with the same base, <b>add</b> the exponents: a<sup>m</sup> × a<sup>n</sup> = a<sup>m + n</sup>. When you divide, <b>subtract</b>: a<sup>m</sup> ÷ a<sup>n</sup> = a<sup>m − n</sup>. This works because 2³ × 2² = (2 × 2 × 2) × (2 × 2) = 2⁵.","tvis":"<div class=\"vis\"><span class=\"vi\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:450px;height:auto\" viewBox=\"0 0 346 46\"><rect x=\"2.0\" y=\"2.0\" width=\"110.0\" height=\"42.0\" fill=\"#E3D6CE\" stroke=\"#555555\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"57.0\" y=\"28.0\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\">2 × 2 × 2</text><rect x=\"118.0\" y=\"2.0\" width=\"34.0\" height=\"42.0\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#555555\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"135.0\" y=\"28.0\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\">×</text><rect x=\"158.0\" y=\"2.0\" width=\"80.0\" height=\"42.0\" fill=\"#E3D6CE\" stroke=\"#555555\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"198.0\" y=\"28.0\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\">2 × 2</text><rect x=\"244.0\" y=\"2.0\" width=\"34.0\" height=\"42.0\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#555555\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"261.0\" y=\"28.0\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\">=</text><rect x=\"284.0\" y=\"2.0\" width=\"60.0\" height=\"42.0\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#555555\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"314.0\" y=\"28.0\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\">2⁵</text></svg></span><div class=\"cap\">2³ × 2² = 2⁵: three 2s and two 2s make five 2s.</div></div>","ex":{"q":"Simplify 3⁶ ÷ 3² and calculate the answer.","steps":["The bases are the same, so subtract the exponents: 6 − 2 = 4.","3⁶ ÷ 3² = 3⁴.","3⁴ = 81."]},"watch":"The laws only work when the bases are the same. 2³ × 3² cannot be written as one power.","qs":[{"text":"Simplify x<sup>5</sup> × x<sup>3</sup>.","vis":"","parts":[{"t":"box","label":"Exponent of x","a":"8","form":"val","o":null}],"hint":"5 + 3","steps":"1. Law: aᵐ × aⁿ = a<sup>m + n</sup>: with the same base, add the exponents.<br>2. x⁵ × x³ = x<sup>5 + 3</sup><br>3. = x⁸ (exponent 8)"},{"text":"Simplify 7⁹ ÷ 7⁶ and calculate the answer.","vis":"","parts":[{"t":"box","label":"Exponent of 7","a":"3","form":"val","o":null},{"t":"box","label":"Value","a":"343","form":"val","o":null}],"hint":"9 − 6","steps":"1. Law: aᵐ ÷ aⁿ = a<sup>m − n</sup>: with the same base, subtract the exponents.<br>2. 7⁹ ÷ 7⁶ = 7<sup>9 − 6</sup> = 7³ (exponent 3)<br>3. 7³ = 343"},{"text":"Calculate 2⁴ × 2³ ÷ 2⁵.","vis":"","parts":[{"t":"box","label":"Answer","a":"4","form":"val","o":null}],"hint":"4 + 3 − 5","steps":"1. Law: aᵐ × aⁿ = a<sup>m + n</sup>: with the same base, add the exponents.<br>2. Law: aᵐ ÷ aⁿ = a<sup>m − n</sup>: with the same base, subtract the exponents.<br>3. 2<sup>4 + 3 − 5</sup> = 2²<br>4. = 4"}]}